:: Thomas Seen School South Hallway [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect School Hallway">> walks down the hallway.
:: Thomas Seen School West Hallway [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect School Hallway">> walks down the hallway. 
:: Thomas Seen School East Hallway [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect School Hallway">> walks down the hallway. 
:: Thomas Seen School Art [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect Art">> is silently drawing alone in the corner.
:: Thomas Seen School Cafeteria [nobr]
	<<switch $ThomasSche.Activity>>
		<<case "School Lunch">>
			<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect School Lunch">> is eating by himself.
		<<case "Cafeteria">>
			<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect Cafeteria">> quietly draws in his notebook.
	<</switch>>
:: Thomas Seen School English Classroom [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect English">> is doodling in his notebook.
:: Thomas Seen School History Classroom [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect History">> is resting his head on his desk.
:: Thomas Seen School Science Classroom [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect Science">> is doodling on his homework.
:: Thomas Seen School Math Classroom [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect Math">> is quietly waiting for class to begin.
:: Thomas Seen School Locker Room [nobr]
	<<switch $ThomasSche.Activity>>
		<<case "Gym">>
			<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect Gym">> is changing in a corner away from the other boys.
		<<case "Gym Shower">>
			<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect Gym Shower">> stands in a corner getting dressed.
	<</switch>>
:: Thomas Seen School Courtyard [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect School Playground">> is quietly drawing at one of the picnic tables.
:: Thomas Seen Middle School [nobr]
	<<inspect "THOMAS Inspect School Waiting for Bus">> is quietly waiting for the bus.
